# CODEOWNERS — narrow ownership for policy-sensitive paths only.
#
# NO blanket `* @GoodOlClint` line, deliberately. Code-level review is
# claude-bot's job via .github/workflows/claude-code-review.yml; a blanket
# owner would require operator approval on every PR, which makes that review
# advisory in practice.
#
# The paths below are the review prompt's own "You defer to @GoodOlClint"
# list (.github/review-prompt.md), expressed as ownership so the deferral is
# ENFORCED rather than requested. Keep the two lists in sync.

# --- Architecture: the decision is the operator's, even when the code is fine
/docs/decisions/                  @GoodOlClint
/plugins/module_utils/            @GoodOlClint

# --- Release / versioning and the dependency surface
/galaxy.yml                       @GoodOlClint
/meta/runtime.yml                 @GoodOlClint
/CHANGELOG.rst                    @GoodOlClint

# --- The rules themselves, and the machinery that enforces them.
/CLAUDE.md                        @GoodOlClint
/CONTRIBUTING.md                  @GoodOlClint
/.github/                         @GoodOlClint
